{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>For who in the skies</b> — כי is as in יעריכנו הכהן (the priest shall estimate him)." "<b>Among the sons of elim</b> — these are the stars. And the meaning: for the masters of the constellations, in their trials, see great wonders and awesome deeds renewed day by day according to the power of the stars and the arrangement of these relative to those; and those who know the knowledge of the Most High know that the deeds of the honored HaShem are yet more and more wondrous."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 89, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:26.072506953Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}